{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項誕生於1954年的「微波激光」技術，正在以鑽石為載體重新登場，並有望幫助量子計算機突破測量瓶頸。日本衝繩科學技術大學院大學的研究團隊開發出一種鑽石微波激射放大器，可將微弱微波信號放大超過1000倍，同時僅引入極低的噪聲，為構建更強大、更易擴展的量子計算機提供了新思路。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587738.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.423785+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:31:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"f73ab18c242ce32a9a6a0f6ecc6e174a47d3fbceff6a3d5342914466c0a3e60e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}